{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d99ddb434a429da4597039185769a9e1959552fe814ba05dd2cebca14a0ffbf",
      "text": "各位。再次祝贺这次的工作圆满收工，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150f0ce9c3d273594f8466d0d49915284e1fb6f9f5be4a62012aabe4ea0bc007",
      "text": "制作人酱也辛苦啦。\n展览会和演出都顺顺利利办成功了，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e988a1c8f47810254726c27315b0c4bc917eb5cf0af0f5718506f5d641f993a",
      "text": "是的！而且听说追加的特别企划\n也获得了空前的热烈反响！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c6fc0791873f35da8fdddb0ff7c5d3f2d265e578f6c99cb2c5cc2dd1fa211be",
      "text": "就是那个展出我们在演出中所使用的\n服装和道具的企划吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf1e6f09a54148261c3ef46c41eae965548deec9a6037cfd1af9f7e77a2eeb19",
      "text": "是的！不仅是支持彩的各位粉丝，\n自不必说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f4c67f511d2e78519d0cd236aa2bdd64f485dff1d463eb3a876cff36c67836",
      "text": "听说连就读于服装专门学校的学生们，\n也都怀着浓厚的兴趣赶来参观了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dcf65549e40aac2e4e10f2ef82bd259f0c9cf135161ada4d7f769239167a864",
      "text": "似乎是负责人在网站上公开的那部分服装特写照片，\n成为了引人注目的契机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945f9ce71306b5cce834b0fdc34d9f180901f561bed187fb99acbc34d335995a",
      "text": "那可真是喵！意料之外的惊喜收获喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fb6480c0d997555dbdaf5822600a617525176c2688efc0a1d90784715f2d7d0",
      "text": "靠大家齐心协力，让展览会比预期中还要热闹得多，\n真是让人开心呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
